          "original_path": "C:\\Users\\Brend\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\10\\24\\rollout-2026-10-24T05-42-14-01a16c77-8bbc-7713-836d-c4c930a173d9_01a16dee-e344-7cc3-81b0-08d7bdb65278.jsonl",
          "source_sha256": "abf13baf72a4dce2bc59ebf08e8996e683fca2b4f28ff80cbbaac4ed058a6e4a",
