          "exact_quote": "**What does “243 million” measure in your calculation—minutes, seconds, days, or something else? If it came from a particular ancestor or source, which one?**\n\ndynamics. that was the number you said related to dna. then we immediately thought about extended human life and it getting progressively shorter over generations (24 to 23) as we also counted years as tempo. was just thinking out loud mostly so you could potentially cvatch something i might have been missing. and you just pointed one out. i saw 360 and thought years instead of correctly thinking degrees. maybe that could mean generation,  but not genealogy, class. 2x 12 hr 360's (720) then back to midnight / 0.\n\nim just spitballing cvause my brain no worksing today",
