            ],
            "proof": "All MT→SP shifts are integer multiples of(50,0), and (50,0)=(650,0)-6(100,0) belongs to their integer span. The SP→Greek shift is(130,1). Thus the exact generated integer lattice H has the stated basis. Negative coefficients concern a representational lattice, not causal backwards generation.",
